SUMMARY:All Ages Karaoke and Board Game Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260428T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260428T193000
UID:695d92cc76261f280062e647@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come sing your favourite tunes on our stage in a fun\, encoura
 ging environment. Request any song and we'll try to find a karaoke video 
 and play it for you! If singing is not your thing\, a few board games will
  be on hand if you want to try out Catan\, Anomia\, Ticket to Ride\, or te
 st your vocabulary with Scrabble! You are also welcome to bring your own a
 nd invite others to play with you.\nChildren must be accompanied by an adu
 lt.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Theatre (downstairs)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/695d92cc76261f280062e647
